<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 214 0 R
/E (70% of French households consume at least one Elle & Vire product during the year, and interview data confirms that many consumers buy cream on a weekly basis. This level of penetration and loyalty is a strong commercial foundation that competitors struggle to match.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
