444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 214 0 R
/E (With aided brand awareness of 88% for cream and 89% for butter, Elle & Vire enjoys exceptional visibility. Its association with renowned chefs like Pierre Gagnaire and its presence in prestigious competitions like Le Bocuse d'Or reinforces its premium credentials, particularly relevant as consumers increasingly seek trusted, high-quality brands for home cooking.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
445 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 214 0 R
/E (3\) A Credible Premium Positionning)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
446 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 214 0 R
/E (Consumer interviews confirm that cream is primarily used as a cooking ingredient \(quiches, pasta, sauces\). As more consumers embrace home cooking and seek quality ingredients, Elle & Vire's positioning as the go-to cream for serious cooking becomes a clear strength.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
