/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (In a context where value for money is an increasingly important decision factor, particularly among younger consumers, this premium pricing risks alienating a growing segment of the market. The Kantar study also confirms that Elle & Vire shoppers tend to concentrate in high-end supermarkets, suggesting limited reach beyond already loyal, affluent consumers.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [14]
>>
