465 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (Elle & Vire's portfolio remains entirely anchored in conventional cow's milk dairy. The brand currently has no plant-based or alternative milk offer, leaving it exposed as consumer preferences diversify, especially among younger generations. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
