/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (The brand's emotional equity is strongly built on nostalgia and tradition which, while powerful among older loyal consumers, may struggle to resonate with younger generations. Combined with price sensitivity Elle & Vire risks a slow erosion of its future consumer base.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [16]
